cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Spatial Domains (BANKSY)
abstract: 'Finds spatial domains in spatial transcriptomics samples (Visium, Visium HD, Xenium, MERSCOPE,
  CosMx) with BANKSY: expression augmented with the neighbourhood mean and an azimuthal Gabor filter term,
  joint PCA, Harmony by sample and Leiden clustering, so domains are shared across samples. Writes domain
  labels, marker genes, per-sample domain fractions, agreement with user annotations and figures.'
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/st-domains
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- spatial-transcriptomics
- transcriptomics
- spatial-domains
- clustering
- banksy
- visium
- xenium
